    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854770/extras/a6ce5def686b05bfa8a3aa5044a20b52.avif?t=1747501704\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT IS WTF (WhatTheFAQ)?</h2><br>WTF is a chaotic first person shooter that confronts heavily armed players with &quot;The Devil&quot; himself. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854770/extras/ed2e147831028c3285cb8e39e9b0db0f.avif?t=1747501704\" /></div><br><br>&quot;The Devil&quot; can take many forms however you will have no doubt when you will see him, as he will wear all of the signs in plain sight.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854770/extras/ea84b9ed69e87b1e4ed8f8f2f8259573.avif?t=1747501704\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SETTING</h2><br>The world of WTF is set on the middle of the desert where you will meet the true evil of this world.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854770/extras/59f58befa3cea0d922c4705db02868ce.avif?t=1747501704\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE PLOT</h2><br>The story starts somewhere on American-Mexican border where you and The Devil had an important discussion about government and taxes.<br><br>As your power of arguments do not work on him, you decide to use the argument of power.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/854770/extras/5a1188bebf3b85f31fb756485804db52.avif?t=1747501704\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br>Variety of &quot;evil&quot; to shoot and dice, ranging from devils from the past, up to the nowadays root of all evil, finishing with the Lord of The Dark Tower.  <br><br>Multiple enemies to defeat with huge arsenal of weapons, ranging from revolvers, shotguns up to long range rifles &amp; automatic guns.  <br><br>WTF will take you on a immersive journey of purification and rooting out evil from this world, once for all.",
